@startuml CollegePlanetAssessmentRoadmap
autonumber
actor Student
boundary "Next.js assessment and roadmap UI" as UI
control "Authenticated server route" as Route
control "Assessment/Roadmap service" as Service
database "PostgreSQL via Prisma" as DB

Student -> UI: Open career assessment
UI -> Route: GET assessment
Route -> Route: Validate session and student role
Route -> Service: Load active assessment
Service -> DB: Read assessment, ordered questions and choices
DB --> Service: Assessment definition
Service --> Route: Assessment definition
Route --> UI: Render questions and progress

loop For each answered question
  Student -> UI: Choose answer and continue
  UI -> Route: Save response(attempt, question, choice)
  Route -> Route: Validate ownership and answer
  Route -> Service: Upsert response
  Service -> DB: Insert/update assessment_attempts and assessment_responses
  DB --> Service: Persisted response
  Service --> Route: Updated completion progress
  Route --> UI: Show next question and progress
end

Student -> UI: Submit assessment
UI -> Route: Submit attempt
Route -> Route: Validate session, ownership and required answers
Route -> Service: Complete attempt and derive career profile
Service -> DB: Transaction: mark attempt submitted; load responses/profile
DB --> Service: Submitted answers and student profile
Service -> Service: Map assessment results to target career role and milestones
Service -> DB: Transaction: create/update roadmap and milestones
DB --> Service: Persisted roadmap
Service --> Route: Roadmap with milestones and progress
Route --> UI: Render roadmap overview

Student -> UI: Add or update a custom goal
UI -> Route: Save goal(roadmap, goal fields)
Route -> Route: Validate roadmap ownership
Route -> Service: Create/update roadmap goal
Service -> DB: Insert/update roadmap_goals
DB --> Service: Persisted goal
Service --> Route: Updated roadmap progress
Route --> UI: Refresh roadmap
@enduml
